<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial" style=""><i style=""><font color="#ff6600" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">&lt;ATTACH 2 pdfs to template: Educational Assistance Program and Educational Assistance Flyer&gt;</font></i><br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[client]</span>_______,&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">I hope you're well. Insperity offers a variety of ancillary benefits that are made available to your employees through the co-employment relationship. One of these benefits is the Education Assistance Program. This program provides eligible employees with tuition assistance so they can obtain additional education.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>I have attached informational flyers and verbiage below that you are welcome to share with your teams as you see fit. You are welcome to copy and paste into a new email then forward the message in its entirety.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Thank you and thank you for allowing Insperity to serve your business.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);">[signature]</span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Dear Employees,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>I would like to share some information for you regarding one of the exciting benefits we have available to us through the Insperity relationship. The <b>Education Assistance Program</b> is available for you to enjoy as you seek to expand your business knowledge or gain a college degree.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Eligible employees who meet program criteria may be reimbursed as follows:&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><ul><li><font face="arial">Up to a maximum of <b>$1,500</b> per calendar year for approved undergraduate or graduate college courses taken as part of an employee's degree program at an accredited institution.&nbsp;</font></li><li><font face="arial">Up to a maximum of <b>$500</b> per calendar year for approved continuing educational expenses (including courses taken at an accredited trade or vocational school, business school or through a professional association)</font></li></ul></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Please view the details of this program in your <a href="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/documents/20230322131437838">Insperity Premier</a> portal. I have also attached a flyer and FAQ to this email for your convenience.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>If you have any specific questions regarding this program, please contact the Insperity Contact Center at 866.715.3552 (Option 1: Benefits) weekdays between 7 a.m. and 7 p.m. Central time.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br>Thank you,</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>